<title>IRAQ: Saddam to deliver speech on U.S. cruise attack.</title>
<headline>Saddam to deliver speech on U.S. cruise attack.</headline>
<dateline>BAGHDAD 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>President Saddam Hussein is to give an address on Tuesday on the U.S. cruise missile attack against his country, the official Iraqi News Agency said.</p>
<p>&quot;President Saddam Hussein will deliver a historic and important speech to the sons of our nation, our valiant armed forces, the sons of our glorious Arab nation and honourable people in the world on the vicious American aggression against the steadfast Iraq,&quot; INA said.</p>
</text>
